    "statement": "In the negative (4,4,2) two-loop skeleton, shared-loop endpoint cancellation in the product-to-q weld forces k_B^2=k_AB k_AC and k_A^2=k_AB k_BC. After normalizing by k_AB, the labels are {1,l,m,m^2,l^2}. Requiring two antipodal pairs and one singleton leaves exactly three loci: one scaled sixth-root hexagon and two placements in a scaled eighth-root six-subset. The three loci remain open; all other signed placements are deleted.",
